<title>USA: Elbit says court OKs demerger.</title>
<headline>Elbit says court OKs demerger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elbit Ltd said Tuesday that Tel Aviv District Court has approved its demerger plan.</p>
<p>Under the plan, each shareholder is to receive two additional shares, one in Elbit Systems Ltd and the other in Elbit Medical Imaging Ltd.</p>
<p>Part of the company's activities would be transferred to the two new companies. Elbit Systems would concentrate on defense systems and Elbit Medical would concentrate on medical imaging and medical centers.</p>
</text>
